.hopper/handoffs/T-033-output.log:526:  "text": "I'll perform the T-031 adversarial review of D6 newapi integration against the cited fact sources and contracts—read-only on the spec, deliverable only in the handoff output.Next I'll cross-check the contract baselines (D1 §7/C-3, D3, D5.4/D5.7, D4, kernel facts) against D6's claims.Checking a few sharp edges: DELETE token confirmation, User-auth credential packaging, and D1 §7 step alignment.Writing the full T-031 adversarial review deliverable.## T-031 完成 — Verdict: **PASS_WITH_NOTE**\n\n已落盘：`.hopper/handoffs/T-031-output.md`（只读评审；未改 D6 / wiki / 事实源）。\n\n### 五维结论\n\n| 维度 | 判定 |\n|------|------|\n| 1 事实保真 | PASS_WITH_NOTE |\n| 2 C-3 诚实 | **PASS** |\n| 3 契约消费 | **PASS** |\n| 4 A/B 叉口 | PASS_WITH_NOTE |\n| 5 自洽完整 | PASS_WITH_NOTE |\n\n### 关键 findings\n\n| ID | 级别 | 要点 |\n|----|------|------|\n| **F-01** | MEDIUM | `DELETE /api/token/:id` 被放进「已确认」清单，但 T-009 仅在注入链叙述出现，无源码路由确认 |\n| **F-02** | MEDIUM | 方案 A「可分发租户级 User 管理凭证」事实源未证实，应标设计假设/未能确认 |\n| **F-03** | MEDIUM | A/B 待裁决材料缺：租户凭证残留权限、Management 网络面、相对 D3 admin-on-server 的偏移 |\n| **F-04** | MEDIUM | path② 保守假设下未写明应跳过 session token 铸造，否则空耗 `GetMaxUserTokens` |\n| **F-05/06** | LOW | §7 统计措辞、§3.1 表头 C1/C2 标签 |\n\n### 总评\n\nD6 v1 **事实纪律与 C-3 诚实度合格**：无臆造渠道/模型 admin REST、未抬升 webhook/correlation、未推翻 D1/D5.4 降级假设。升 `confirmed` 前短修订 F-01～F-04 即可；**不必重写**。",
